{
  "esm": "1.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "latlon_advection_meridional_zero_grad",
    "description": "MMS driver: forced meridional advection on the global latlon grid, u_t = -v_deg * D(u, lat) + v_deg * dPdlat, discretized by grids/latlon/rules/central_D_lat_zero_grad_bc (2nd-order centered interior, one-sided zero-gradient pole rows). Manufactured STEADY solution u*(lat) = cos^4((pi/180) lat) — a P2-like polar-cap profile — with the exactly matching steady forcing v_deg * dPdlat, dPdlat = -4 (pi/180) cos^3(Phi) sin(Phi), Phi = (pi/180) lat (the analytic per-degree meridional derivative of u*), so u_t = 0 and u(t) = u* for all t in the continuous problem; the discrete field drifts only by the spatial truncation error, which is what the assertions and the convergence sweep measure. BC COMPATIBILITY (why cos^4 and not cos or cos^2): u* has dP/dPhi = -4 cos^3 sin, d2P/dPhi2 = 12 cos^2 sin^2 - 4 cos^4, and d3P/dPhi3 = -24 cos sin^3 + 40 cos^3 sin ... all carrying a cos factor, so the first THREE Phi-derivatives vanish at the poles: the rule's one-sided face value (u[i,2]-u[i,1])/dlat_deg = u_lat(pole + dlat/2) + O(dlat^2) = O(dlat^3) is superconvergently consistent with the exact pole value 0, and the global error is cleanly O(dlat^2) from the interior stencil alone (a profile with nonzero pole curvature, e.g. cos^2, would degrade the face residual to O(dlat) and pollute the observed order). GRID CONTRACT WIRING (grids/latlon/grid.esm): NLON is closed to 8 at the import edge (the lon axis is passive — the solution is zonally symmetric and no lon operator appears), NLAT stays open (default 91, rebound by the convergence sweep via the loader API); dlat_deg = 180/(NLAT-1) is an observed whose expression uses the metaparameter NAME NLAT (substituted at load per esm-spec 9.7.6), so the sweep keeps the spacing consistent; lat0_deg = -90. The ic, forcing, and test references inline the grid's lat_coord convention (lat_j = -90 + (j-1) * 180/(NLAT-1) via the NLAT name) instead of invoking the lat_coord template: free-name geometry is not resolvable in the bindings' build-time ic/reference evaluator (parameters and observeds are out of scope there — upstream limitation, EarthSciAST tree-walk _eval_cellwise), so geometry in ic/reference positions must fold to constants at load. ERROR MODEL: with v_deg = 30 and t = 0.2 (the solution 'would have' transported 6 degrees against the fixed forcing), the truncation-driven drift gives relative L2 errors falling as O(dlat^2) over the NLAT = 17/33/65/129 ladder; exact per-resolution values are pinned in tests/conformance/convergence/latlon_advection_meridional_zero_grad/golden/errors.json.",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:problem",
      "grid:latlon",
      "equation:advection",
      "mms"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Roache, P. J. (2002). Code verification by the method of manufactured solutions. J. Fluids Eng. 124(1), 4-10.",
        "doi": "10.1115/1.1436090"
      },
      {
        "citation": "LeVeque, R. J. (2007). Finite Difference Methods for Ordinary and Partial Differential Equations. SIAM. Section 2.12 (boundary-compatible manufactured solutions and one-sided closures)."
      }
    ]
  },
  "models": {
    "MeridionalAdvection": {
      "expression_template_imports": [
        {
          "ref": "../grids/latlon/rules/central_D_lat_zero_grad_bc.esm",
          "bindings": {
            "NLON": 8
          }
        }
      ],
      "variables": {
        "u": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "lon",
            "lat"
          ],
          "description": "Tracer field over the lon x lat index sets (zonally symmetric in this problem)."
        },
        "v_deg": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "deg/s",
          "default": 30,
          "description": "Constant meridional transport speed in degrees of latitude per second (positive northward). Multiplies both the discretized derivative and the manufactured forcing, so the steady MMS balance holds for any value."
        },
        "dlat_deg": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "deg",
          "description": "Meridional spacing 180/(NLAT-1) (pole-to-pole point grid): the grid's dlat_deg free name (consumer-supplied geometry contract, grids/latlon/grid.esm). NLAT is the document-scoped metaparameter, substituted as an integer literal at load (esm-spec 9.7.6), so loader-API rebinding for the convergence sweep keeps dlat_deg consistent."
        },
        "dPdlat": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1/deg",
          "shape": [
            "lon",
            "lat"
          ],
          "description": "Analytic per-degree meridional derivative of the manufactured solution: dPdlat(lat) = -4 (pi/180) cos^3((pi/180) lat) sin((pi/180) lat). Constant in time and longitude; v_deg * dPdlat is the manufactured forcing that holds u* = cos^4 steady."
        }
      },
      "equations": [
        {
          "lhs": {
            "op": "ic",
            "args": [
              "u"
            ]
          },
          "rhs": {
            "op": "^",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "cos",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "/",
                        "args": [
                          3.141592653589793,
                          180
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "op": "aggregate",
                        "output_idx": [
                          "i",
                          "j"
                        ],
                        "args": [],
                        "ranges": {
                          "i": {
                            "from": "lon"
                          },
                          "j": {
                            "from": "lat"
                          }
                        },
                        "expr": {
                          "op": "+",
                          "args": [
                            -90,
                            {
                              "op": "*",
                              "args": [
                                {
                                  "op": "-",
                                  "args": [
                                    "j",
                                    1
                                  ]
                                },
                                {
                                  "op": "/",
                                  "args": [
                                    180,
                                    {
                                      "op": "-",
                                      "args": [
                                        "NLAT",
                                        1
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              4
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": {
            "op": "D",
            "args": [
              "u"
            ],
            "wrt": "t"
          },
          "rhs": {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "-",
                    "args": [
                      "v_deg"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "op": "D",
                    "args": [
                      "u"
                    ],
                    "wrt": "lat"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  "v_deg",
                  "dPdlat"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "dlat_deg",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              180,
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                  "NLAT",
                  1
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "dPdlat",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "aggregate",
            "output_idx": [
              "i",
              "j"
            ],
            "args": [],
            "ranges": {
              "i": {
                "from": "lon"
              },
              "j": {
                "from": "lat"
              }
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "*",
              "args": [
                -4,
                {
                  "op": "/",
                  "args": [
                    3.141592653589793,
                    180
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "op": "^",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "cos",
                      "args": [
                        {
                          "op": "*",
                          "args": [
                            {
                              "op": "/",
                              "args": [
                                3.141592653589793,
                                180
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "op": "+",
                              "args": [
                                -90,
                                {
                                  "op": "*",
                                  "args": [
                                    {
                                      "op": "-",
                                      "args": [
                                        "j",
                                        1
                                      ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "op": "/",
                                      "args": [
                                        180,
                                        {
                                          "op": "-",
                                          "args": [
                                            "NLAT",
                                            1
                                          ]
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    3
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "op": "sin",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "*",
                      "args": [
                        {
                          "op": "/",
                          "args": [
                            3.141592653589793,
                            180
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "op": "+",
                          "args": [
                            -90,
                            {
                              "op": "*",
                              "args": [
                                {
                                  "op": "-",
                                  "args": [
                                    "j",
                                    1
                                  ]
                                },
                                {
                                  "op": "/",
                                  "args": [
                                    180,
                                    {
                                      "op": "-",
                                      "args": [
                                        "NLAT",
                                        1
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "tests": [
        {
          "id": "mms_steady_polar_cap",
          "description": "Manufactured steady solution u*(lat) = cos^4((pi/180) lat) with v_deg = 30. Derivation: the continuous balance is u_t = -v u*_lat + v u*_lat = 0 with u*_lat = dPdlat = -4 (pi/180) cos^3 sin (per-degree); the first three Phi-derivatives of u* vanish at both poles, so u* is compatible with the rule's zero-gradient pole rows to O(dlat^3) (see metadata.description) and the discrete drift is pure interior O(dlat^2) truncation. The t=0 assertion pins the ic wiring (reference equals the initial field). The t=0.2 assertion bounds the truncation-driven drift against the SAME steady reference: 7.91e-3 relative L2 at the sweep's coarsest NLAT=17 and 2.55e-4 at the default NLAT=91, so the 0.02 bound holds across the whole convergence ladder with a >2x margin (exact per-resolution errors pinned in tests/conformance/convergence/latlon_advection_meridional_zero_grad/golden/errors.json). The max assertion (u* attains 1 at the equator row, present for every odd NLAT) guards against a uniform-shift/forcing-sign defect that the relative L2 could disguise.",
          "time_span": {
            "start": 0.0,
            "end": 0.2
          },
          "assertions": [
            {
              "variable": "u",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0.0,
              "tolerance": {
                "abs": 1e-09
              },
              "reduce": "L2_error",
              "reference": {
                "op": "^",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "cos",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "*",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "/",
                            "args": [
                              3.141592653589793,
                              180
                            ]
                          },
                          {
                            "op": "aggregate",
                            "output_idx": [
                              "i",
                              "j"
                            ],
                            "args": [],
                            "ranges": {
                              "i": {
                                "from": "lon"
                              },
                              "j": {
                                "from": "lat"
                              }
                            },
                            "expr": {
                              "op": "+",
                              "args": [
                                -90,
                                {
                                  "op": "*",
                                  "args": [
                                    {
                                      "op": "-",
                                      "args": [
                                        "j",
                                        1
                                      ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "op": "/",
                                      "args": [
                                        180,
                                        {
                                          "op": "-",
                                          "args": [
                                            "NLAT",
                                            1
                                          ]
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  4
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "u",
              "time": 0.2,
              "expected": 0.0,
              "tolerance": {
                "abs": 0.02
              },
              "reduce": "L2_error",
              "reference": {
                "op": "^",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "cos",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "*",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "/",
                            "args": [
                              3.141592653589793,
                              180
                            ]
                          },
                          {
                            "op": "aggregate",
                            "output_idx": [
                              "i",
                              "j"
                            ],
                            "args": [],
                            "ranges": {
                              "i": {
                                "from": "lon"
                              },
                              "j": {
                                "from": "lat"
                              }
                            },
                            "expr": {
                              "op": "+",
                              "args": [
                                -90,
                                {
                                  "op": "*",
                                  "args": [
                                    {
                                      "op": "-",
                                      "args": [
                                        "j",
                                        1
                                      ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "op": "/",
                                      "args": [
                                        180,
                                        {
                                          "op": "-",
                                          "args": [
                                            "NLAT",
                                            1
                                          ]
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  4
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "u",
              "time": 0.2,
              "expected": 1.0,
              "tolerance": {
                "abs": 0.05
              },
              "reduce": "max"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
